          <choice_text>XSS</choice_text>
          <commentary>XSS이므로 정답이다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
        <choice_explanation no="2" is_answer="false" judgment="[X]">
          <choice_text>SQL Injection</choice_text>
          <commentary>SQL Injection은 질의문을 조작하는 공격이다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
        <choice_explanation no="3" is_answer="false" judgment="[X]">
          <choice_text>DNS Spoofing</choice_text>
          <commentary>DNS Spoofing은 도메인 응답을 위조하는 공격이다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
        <choice_explanation no="4" is_answer="false" judgment="[X]">
          <choice_text>IP Spoofing</choice_text>
