      <overall_commentary>출제 영역: 정보시스템보안 · Sticky Bit
정답은 ④이다. chmod 1111에서 첫 자리 1은 특수권한 Sticky Bit(4는 SetUID, 2는 SetGID)이고, 나머지 111은 소유자·그룹·기타 사용자에게 실행 권한만 부여한다.</overall_commentary>
      <choice_explanations>
        <choice_explanation no="1" is_answer="false" judgment="[X]">
          <choice_text>Read</choice_text>
          <commentary>읽기 권한은 부여되지 않는다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
        <choice_explanation no="2" is_answer="false" judgment="[X]">
          <choice_text>SetGID</choice_text>
          <commentary>SetGID는 2이다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
        <choice_explanation no="3" is_answer="false" judgment="[X]">
          <choice_text>SetUID</choice_text>
          <commentary>SetUID는 4이다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
        <choice_explanation no="4" is_answer="true" judgment="[O] (정답)">
          <choice_text>Sticky Bit</choice_text>
          <commentary>Sticky Bit이므로 정답이다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
      </choice_explanations>
